2019t just for deception\u2014it\u2019s a strategic tool. Players must read behavior, form alliances, and act with perfect timing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222130/extras/d39a8214cba723a7f33a8406aef26d45.poster.avif?t=1771945587\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222130/extras/d39a8214cba723a7f33a8406aef26d45.webm?t=1771945587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222130/extras/d39a8214cba723a7f33a8406aef26d45.mp4?t=1771945587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as animated voodoo dolls trapped in a cursed medieval castle, secretly divided into two hidden teams: <strong>Good Voodoos</strong> and <strong>Bad Voodoos</strong>. Bluff, deceive, craft magical cards, and outwit your opponents in a high-stakes battle of trust and betrayal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222130/extras/ec82164fa9a3842675ad889eb20b4673.poster.avif?t=1771945587\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222130/extras/ec82164fa9a3842675ad889eb20b4673.webm?t=1771945587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222130/extras/ec82164fa9a3842675ad889eb20b4673.mp4?t=1771945587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also customize your voodoo doll characters with a variety of skins and cosmetics to express your style and stand out during the chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you protect the innocent, spread chaos from the shadows, or simply mess with everyone for fun? In Who Do Voodoo, trust no one and play your cards right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-Based Hidden Roles</strong>: Players are secretly divided into two opposing teams: Good Voodoos and Bad Voodoos. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Gameplay</strong>: Play three types of cards\u2014Good, Bad, and Fun\u2014to protect teammates, sabotage enemies, or prank everyone. Every action counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Crafting System:\u00a0</strong>Collect items around the map and combine them to craft powerful or unpredictable cards mid-match.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Player Interaction</strong>: Use cards on other players in real time. Direct, reactive gameplay shaped by timing and intuition.\u00a0Communicate with others through in-game voice chat system, including proximity chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-Roam Map</strong>: Move freely around the map with no fixed paths or movement restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD Movement &amp; Mouse Controls</strong>: Navigate the map using WASD and interact with players, cards, and voting systems with intuitive mouse controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong>: Unlock and equip unique skins and cosmetics to personalize your voodoo doll and express your style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Map Available (More to Come)</strong>: The game currently features a single detailed map. More themed maps are planned for future updates. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Kuixo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}